# === Visual baseline screenshots ===
# Regenerable from the code at any commit, so they stay local. The small,
# diffable probe report next to them (layout-probe-*.json) IS tracked.
docs/frontend-baseline/*.png

# === Docs stay local (workspace convention) ===
# Already-tracked files under docs/ keep being tracked; this only stops new ones.
docs/

